ppear only inside a string literal in ECMAScript\n\n**Note:** an expression that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` whenever it is evaluated\n\n**Help:** text in an expression must be a quoted string literal: write `'😀 hi'`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.2 The ECMAScript Data Model","text":"ecmascript syntax error in `expr`: `😀` can appear only inside a string literal in ECMAScript"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":312,"start":308},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `expr`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-ecmascript-lexer-wording.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":23,"endLine":8,"startColumn":18,"startLine":8}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-ecmascript-lexer-wording.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":13,"byteOffset":336,"endColumn":31,"endLine":9,"startColumn":18,"startLine":9},"insertedContent":{"text":"'Error: failed'"}}]}],"description":{"text":"quote the text as a string literal"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-ecmascript-lexer-wording.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":24,"endLine":9,"startColumn":23,"startLine":9}}}],"message":{"markdown":"ecmascript syntax error in `expr`: unexpected `:` after a complete expression\n\n**Note:** an expression that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` whenever it is evaluated\n\n**Help:** text in an expression must be a quoted string literal: write `'Error: failed'`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.2 The ECMAScript Data Model","text":"ecmascript syntax error in `expr`: unexpected `:` after a complete expression"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":342,"start":341},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `expr`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifac